  "validation_scope": {
    "zh": "Lean 4.29.1 合并检查器实查（回执 20261015T173702.509759Z）：Becoming.Typicality 的 44 项声明（32 项定理）公理报告为空；检查器并核对核心纯净。作者反审见研究 §140；未经独立审查。",
    "en": "Machine-checked by the consolidated Lean 4.29.1 checker (receipt 20261015T173702.509759Z): the 44 declarations of Becoming.Typicality, 32 of them theorems, have empty axiom reports; the checker verifies core purity. Author counterreview in study section 140; not independently reviewed."
